<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Xyrtula | Dijital Atölye</title>
    <style>
        /* Modern ve temiz bir görünüm için CSS */
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #0f172a; /* Derin lacivert/siyah tonu */
            color: #f8fafc;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .card {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3rem;
            border-radius: 24px;
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            max-width: 500px;
            width: 90%;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            margin: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #38bdf8, #818cf8);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .status-dot {
            height: 10px;
            width: 10px;
            background-color: #22c55e;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-right: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px #22c55e;
        }

        .url-text {
            font-family: monospace;
            background: #334155;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #38bdf8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="card">
        <h1>XYRTULA</h1>
        <p><span class="status-dot"></span> Dijital dünya için üretim aşamasında...</p>
        <p>Resmi adres: <span class="url-text">xyrtula.github.io</span></p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
